Revision history for Shannon-Entropy-XS

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

1.12	01/04/2026
	- Add custom op which improves performance from 5952380.95/s to 7633587.79/s in benchmark

1.17	08/10/2026
	- Fix assertion failure in newUNOP on DEBUGGING perls (5.18, 5.20)
	- Only replace the call with the custom op when the argument is a
	  single scalar; a list argument left extra values on the stack
	- Register the custom op as a UNOP so B::Concise can walk it
